Package: GateLabR
Title: Interactive Manual Gating for SingleCellExperiment Objects
Version: 1.4.6
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Priest", email = "david.priest898@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0095-6718"))
Description: An interactive application for manual gating of
    flow cytometry and mass cytometry (CyTOF) data directly on
    SingleCellExperiment objects. The shared GateLab TypeScript and React
    interface is hosted by a thin R adapter that streams SCE assays, performs
    R-native compensation, and writes panel labels and event annotations back
    to rowData and colData. Supports polygon, rectangle and quadrant gates,
    positive-AND population hierarchies, explicit linear and transformed assay
    spaces, GatingML 2.0 exchange, FCS export, publication-style figures, and a
    cell-division profiler. Gates, populations, scales, assay bindings and
    settings persist inside the object's metadata.
